  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Hyper-G Soft is the softer member of the Hyper-G family, developed to preserve the extreme spin, bite, power and control of the original while providing a more comfortable and elastic response. A specially developed softening chemical formula works with a shaped high-powered polyester monofilament to increase playability and improve tension maintenance. Available in 1.15, 1.20, 1.25 and 1.30 mm gauges, it is ideal for players who want the aggressive performance of Hyper-G with a softer stringbed feel.",

    "zh": "Solinco Hyper-G Soft 是 Hyper-G 家族中的柔和版本，在保留标准 Hyper-G 强旋转、强咬球、力量和控制优势的同时，通过专门开发的柔化化学配方带来更舒适、更有弹性的击球反馈，并进一步改善保磅能力。产品提供 1.15、1.20、1.25 与 1.30 毫米四种线径，非常适合希望获得 Hyper-G 进攻性能，但又不喜欢过硬线床感觉的中高级球员。"
  },

